title = "Priest Training"

[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
<h2>Priest Training</h2>
<p>As you will no doubt be wanting to play the multiplayer game at some stage, you might want to be prepared, there are a lot of skilled players out there who have been playing a while, these tutorials are here to help you practice on what to expect.

<p>If you want a more visual indication on what you are picking, please choose the "menu" button.

<p>~B~E~b-BlueCheese

